      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you implemented binderDied on CaptivePortalImpl, you could:\n\n```\ntry {\n    binder.asBinder().linkToDeath(this);\n} catch (RemoteException e) {\n    binderDied(); // \u003c-- may not be necessary, but this seems to be a pattern.\n    return;\n}\n```\n\n```\n@Override\npublic void binderDied() {\n    mHandler.post(() -\u003e clearDelegateUid());\n}\n```\n\n```\nprivate void clearDelegateUid() {\n    final NetworkAgentInfo nai \u003d getNetworkAgentInfoForNetwork(mNetwork);\n    if (nai \u003d\u003d null) return; // network disappeared, nothing to do.\n    nai.clearCaptivePortalDelegateUid();\n}\n```",
